('PUBLIC', NULL, '摩洛哥意面', 'Moroccan Spaghetti (Very Low Fat and Healthy)', '["摩洛哥风味意面"]', '["午餐", "晚餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["低油", "均衡"]', '[]', '["咸鲜"]', '["快速"]', 'We had this for our main meal tonight. I rather heavily adapted it from the UK tv chef, Simon Rimmer''s book ''Accidental Vegetarian''. I knocked out most of the fat he had in it (though it was all good fat) and changed around some ingredients to make it more low GI friendly. On top of being tasty this is pretty healthy. It is vegetarian, vegan, low fat, nearly saturated fat free and great for those of us with insulin issues because it is full of slow burning carbs with a low glycemic load. You could of course use normal spaghetti rather than the whole wheat kind but I use that just because it has a ton of fibre in it.', '["red onion", "garlic cloves", "mushroom", "chopped tomatoes", "cinnamon", "ground cumin", "turmeric", "salt", "black pepper", "chickpeas", "fresh parsley", "fresh cilantro"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '426.70', '18.50', '2.80', '89.60', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["麸质"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '301361', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '蒜姜面筋', 'Garlic-Ginger Seitan from Scratch', '["素肉面筋", "Seitan"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["低油", "均衡", "高蛋白"]', '[]', '[]', '["快速", "慢享"]', 'Making seitan yourself is much easier and cheaper than buying it. You also have control over the seitan''s seasoning. It may seem time consuming, but it actually requires very little attention. If you can''t find vital wheat gluten flour, there are many websites that sell it. I bought my flour from www.bobsredmill.com. This is a great high-protein substitute for chicken or tofu in any meal. My favorite way to prepare it is to roast it and serve it with veggies and some kind of grain. It''s also great and easy to prepare in stir-frys.', '["vital wheat gluten flour", "soy sauce", "garlic", "ginger"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '135.20', '26.40', '0.60', '6.70', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["鸡蛋", "麸质", "大豆"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '302090', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
