('PUBLIC', NULL, '坦都里风味海鲜串', 'Tandoori-Style Seafood Kabobs', '["海鲜串", "Tandoori Kabobs"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["均衡", "控碳水"]', '["东南亚菜"]', '[]', '[]', 'Another tasty recipe from Thai Cooking & More for the grill which I only slightly modified NOTE - any firm fish can be used for this, such as tuna steak or swordfish steak. Or use a combination of if you have access to them NOTE 2- prep time does NOT include 1 hour marinating time.', '["salmon fillet", "salt", "ground cumin", "black pepper", "cinnamon", "ground cloves", "ground nutmeg", "ground cardamom", "low-fat yogurt", "lemon juice", "fresh ginger", "olive oil", "garlic cloves", "red bell pepper", "green bell pepper"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '326.30', '48.20', '10.10', '9.10', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "鱼"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '304522', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '意式火鸡肉汉堡', 'Italian Turkey Burgers (Reduced Fat)', '["低脂火鸡汉堡"]', '["加餐", "午餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["均衡", "控碳水", "高蛋白"]', '[]', '[]', '["快速", "慢享"]', 'I have been playing around lately with trying to make different kinds of reduced fat burgers to go with the low fat eating plan I am on. This is my latest attempt. I used ground turkey breast so that I didn''t feel that bad about having a little bit of fat from the sundried tomatoes but at least it is ''good'' fats. The cooking time includes the one hour chilling time.', '["onion", "fresh basil", "sun-dried tomatoes packed in oil", "garlic powder"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '160.60', '29.90', '1.40', '5.50', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '[]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '304891', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '烤土豆', 'Over Stuffed Potatoes', '["焗土豆"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["低油", "均衡"]', '[]', '[]', '["快速", "慢享"]', 'NOTE: FOR "NEWLY DIAGNOSED DIABETICS" IN MODERATION STARCHES ARE GOOD. USE COMMON SENSE WHEN PLANNING YOUR MEALS. YOU SHOULD NOT CUT OUT STARCHES TOTALLY. IF YOU SHOULD EAT A SMALL PORTION OF STARCH EARLY IN THE AFTERNOON, IF NOT A SMALL PORTION IS FINE IN THE EVENING. PICK A SMALL POTATOE NOT ONE THAT''S THE SIZE OF A FOOTBALL. NEWLY DIAGNOSED: SUB LOW FAT DAIRY AND MAKE YOUR OWN ADJUSTMENTS. DON''T REVIEW A RECIPE WITHOUT RESEARCH AND COMMON SENSE. Starches are good for diabetics, it''s really a matter of what they are paired with for a meal. These are great with a protein (chicken or fish even broiled or grilled meats. Serve a nice green salad along side this dish and you have a great filling meal. Cook time includes prep time.', '["potatoes", "flour", "nutmeg", "low-fat milk", "low-fat milk", "reduced-fat extra sharp cheddar cheese", "salt", "broccoli"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '288.50', '18.70', '5.90', '41.80', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "麸质", "鱼"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '311924', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
