('PUBLIC', NULL, '黑豆塔可配菲达', 'Crispy Black Bean Tacos With Feta & Cabbage Slaw', '["脆皮豆塔可"]', '["午餐", "晚餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["低油"]', '[]', '["咸鲜", "奶香", "辣"]', '["快速"]', 'This is an awesome recipe from The Bon Appetit Test Kitchen! The flavours really work well together. Not only is it fast, easy, satisfying, and delicious, it is healthy, vegetarian, and low calorie too! You can omit the feta to make it vegan. Recipe was printed in the latest Bon Appetit Magazine (Feb. 2009). To cut down the fat, eat them open-faced as a taco salad. Use a griddle to prepare multiple tacos at once.', '["black beans", "ground cumin", "olive oil", "fresh lime juice", "green onions", "fresh cilantro", "parsley", "corn tortillas", "wheat flour tortillas", "feta cheese", "chipotle hot sauce"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '249.70', '10.60', '9.50', '32.50', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "麸质"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '350971', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '素食无豆辣椒', 'Vegetarian Beanless Chili', '["素辣椒", "Vegan Chili"]', '["午餐", "晚餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["低油", "均衡"]', '[]', '[]', '["快速", "慢享"]', 'like the taste of chili but hate beans? me too! you could use real ground beef if you wanted (equivalent is 1lbs before cooking) and throw in a can of beans i suppose but i like it like this. lots of flavor, tons of healthy veggies and protein. really low fat unless you load it with sour cream and cheese. freezes really well and you can make it really fast (but not as healthy) with instant rice. feel free to throw in whatever veggies you have left over. tonight i''m adding celery, green pepper, and mushrooms! nom nom nom', '["crushed tomatoes", "carrots", "zucchini", "onion", "vegetarian ground beef", "brown rice", "chili powder", "salt", "garlic clove", "water"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '373.40', '26.40', '8.80', '49.30', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "鸡蛋"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '351694', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
