('PUBLIC', NULL, '蜜桃藜麦杯', 'Crunchy Peaches and Cream Quinoa', '["桃子藜麦"]', '["早餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["低油", "均衡"]', '[]', '[]', '["快速"]', 'I tasty breakfast dish that uses the "super food" quinoa. Quinoa''s protein content is very high, making it great vegetarians and vegans. It also contains a balanced set of essential amino acids for making it an unusually complete protein source and is a good source of dietary fiber and phosphorus. Quinoa is gluten-free and high in magnesium and iron. What a better way to start the day!!', '["water", "1% low-fat milk", "quinoa", "butter", "honey", "vanilla extract", "cinnamon", "pecan halves"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '257.60', '8.10', '6.00', '44.20', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["坚果", "牛奶", "麸质"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '369453', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
