('PUBLIC', NULL, '卡津黑化鸡胸', 'Cajun Blackened Skillet Chicken!', '["Cajun 鸡胸"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["均衡", "控碳水", "高蛋白"]', '[]', '[]', '["快速"]', 'Wonderful and light way to make cajun blackened chicken! I serve it with dirty rice and veggies. It is also excellent the next day cold with light mayo, lettuce, and tomato on pita bread! If you want to lower the heat, omit the cayenne! This chicken is delicious!', '["dried oregano", "paprika", "ground ginger", "black pepper", "cayenne", "olive oil", "boneless skinless chicken breasts", "salt"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '166.00', '27.50', '5.10', '1.30', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["鸡蛋", "麸质"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '37448', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '草莓酸奶杯', 'Yogurt Strawberry Blast', '["草莓酸奶"]', '["午餐", "早餐", "晚餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["低油", "均衡"]', '[]', '["奶香"]', '["快速"]', 'Make and share this Yogurt Strawberry Blast recipe from Food.com.', '["low-fat plain yogurt", "strawberries", "fructose", "low fat cottage cheese", "olive oil"]', 1, '1.00', '份', '351.00', '22.30', '8.70', '48.20', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '37487', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '燕麦司康', 'Steel Cut Oatmeal Scones', '["燕麦松饼", "Oatmeal Scones"]', '["下午茶", "早餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["均衡"]', '["甜品"]', '[]', '["慢享"]', 'Very slightly sweet, quite healthy compared to your average scone. If you want this sweet add another 1/2 cup sugar or splenda!! Great for on the go. This is also great if you add a cup of dried fruit such as blueberries, cherries or currants at the end. Be careful not to overmix and remember, these are not meant to be sweet. Caution this is a fairly moist dough, just use quite a bit of flour to avoid sticking. This recipe is lower calorie, high fiber, high protein (for a scone), and very low GI. These will keep you full for a very long time.', '["steel cut oats", "low-fat buttermilk", "egg", "unsweetened applesauce", "light brown sugar", "whole wheat pastry flour", "all-purpose flour", "butter", "salt", "cream of tartar", "baking soda", "baking powder", "cinnamon", "nutmeg", "vanilla extract"]', 24, '1.00', '份', '170.30', '5.10', '5.40', '26.20', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "鸡蛋", "麸质"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '374879', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '清淡蔬菜蛋白煎蛋卷', 'Light, Delicious Vegetable Egg White Omelet', '["蛋白蔬菜蛋卷"]', '["早餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["低油", "均衡", "控碳水"]', '[]', '[]', '["快速"]', 'This recipe is a great way to start off the day without the cholesterol or fat of a whole egg without sacrificing any of the flavor! Usually egg white omelets are really bland unless you stuff them with cheese, which cancels out the entire purpose of using egg whites. Anyway, wanting a delicious egg white omelet for breakfast one sunday morning, i whipped this up and was astounded with its amazing flavor! Using a lot of veggies kept me full until lunch, and the protein in the egg whites kept me going all day. Enjoy! This recipe can be easily altered by adding meat or different vegetables, i am a vegetarian so i didn''t put any meat in. Also, change the cheeses to whatever you like, i used mozerella to keep the flavor mild. Note: Braggs liquid aminos is a healthy soy sauce substitute that adds protein and flavor to any desired dish. It can be found at most regular grocery stores and if not, at any health food store. If you don''t have braggs, use soy sauce to taste on top of omelet. It sounds weird, but adds delicious flavor to the omelet!', '["broccoli", "mushroom", "tomatoes", "mozzarella cheese", "cumin", "rosemary", "salt", "pepper"]', 1, '1.00', '份', '191.60', '23.70', '7.20', '8.80', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "鸡蛋", "大豆"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '376226', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '低脂墨西哥辣椒玉米松饼', 'Low-Fat Jalapeno Cornbread Muffins', '["玉米松饼"]', '["下午茶", "早餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["低油", "均衡"]', '["甜品"]', '[]', '["快速"]', 'This was inspired by Normaone''s Low-fat Southern Cornbread, which is a great recipe, and includes several changes that I made to suit our taste, including adding low-fat cheese and fat free sour cream. I used an artificial sweetener that measures cup for cup. This recipe creates a dense, slightly sweet cornbread with a kick! Like it spicier? Add more jalapenos!', '["yellow cornmeal", "all-purpose flour", "baking soda", "salt", "low calorie sweetener", "fat free sour cream", "egg substitute", "corn", "low-fat cheddar cheese"]', 12, '1.00', '份', '135.60', '5.80', '1.60', '25.00', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "鸡蛋", "麸质"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '377420', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
