('PUBLIC', NULL, '低脂菠菜蘸酱', 'Low Fat/Carb Spinach Dip', '["菠菜蘸"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '["快速"]', 'The DH & I are trying to cut back a bit so I have had to be creative making things we used to enjoy healthy! I found this searching the web for low carb snacks. It is great with fresh veggies and also on crackers!!!', '["low-fat sour cream", "nonfat sour cream", "frozen chopped spinach"]', 10, '1.00', '份', '57.80', '2.20', '4.60', '2.80', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "鸡蛋"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '391554', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '芦笋清汤', 'Ww Asparagas Soup 1 Point', '["低卡芦笋汤"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["低油", "均衡"]', '[]', '[]', '["快速"]', 'From Gina''s Weight Watcher''s Blog: It doesn''t get better than this in my book! Yum! Don''t be fooled, just because it''s creamed doesn''t mean in bad for you. Simply pureeing the soup with an immersion blender and adding a little low fat sour cream does the trick. If you don''t have one of these hand blenders, you really must get one of these. They save so much time in the kitchen. This soup is perfect as a first course or great for lunch. To make this thicker as a main course, you can add a large peeled russet potat', '["asparagus", "butter", "onion", "fat free chicken broth", "low-fat sour cream"]', 6, '1.00', '份', '69.50', '4.60', '3.10', '8.50', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '391946', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '清炖鱼排', 'Poached Fish', '["水煮鱼"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["均衡", "高蛋白"]', '[]', '[]', '["快速"]', 'This is one of my favorite ways to cook fish. Add a lovely sauce it is so moist and tasty. I like to poach Salmon, cod and sea bass. There are many sauce recipes here on Zaar or serve it plain with a dab of butter. I like to use a lightly greased rack so the fish is just above the water, espcially if it is a skinless filet', '["fresh parsley", "dried dill weed", "onion", "lemon slices", "vermouth"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '192.20', '39.20', '1.50', '3.40', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "鱼"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '39264', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '健康班尼迪克蛋', 'Clean Eggs Benedict', '["班尼迪克蛋", "Eggs Benedict"]', '["早餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["低油", "均衡"]', '[]', '["奶香"]', '["快速"]', 'For spinach lovers. This recipe comes from Clean Eating magazine. Uses portobello mushrooms instead of ham or bacon. Am also posting their smoked salmon recipe, feel free to sub that in for the mushrooms if you wish.', '["whole wheat flour", "skim milk", "low-fat sharp cheddar cheese", "sea salt", "black pepper", "olive oil", "portabella mushrooms", "olive oil flavored cooking spray", "whole grain English muffins"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '320.30', '26.00', '5.60', '42.80', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "鸡蛋", "麸质", "鱼"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '393355', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '低脂肉酱三明治', 'Cabinkat''s Favorite Low-Fat Sloppy Joes', '["Sloppy Joes", "肉酱堡"]', '["午餐", "晚餐"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'My kids absolutely love these sloppy joes. They prefer these over Manwich. I haven''t told them that they are even healthy. I recommend serving on toasted white wheat hamburger buns for a tasty low calorie meal.', '["ground turkey", "butter", "margarine", "celery", "onion", "red wine vinegar", "light brown sugar", "ketchup", "Worcestershire sauce", "prepared mustard"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '279.10', '20.80', '12.50', '21.90', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "麸质"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '394139', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '鸡肉蘑菇菠菜意面', 'Farfalle With Chicken, Mushrooms, Spinach and Ricotta Cheese', '["奶油鸡意面"]', '["午餐", "晚餐"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '["奶香"]', '[]', 'This is a nice light pasta - the sauce isn''t heavy (or, really, very saucy at all) and the ricotta makes it just a touch creamy. It''s also quite healthy. This is one of those recipes that can be made quickly with what you have in the kitchen! Instead of overdoing the pasta - we used whole wheat pasta & bulked it up with veggies and lean chicken breast. The finished dish is very eye appealing and tastes marvelous! ellysaysopa.com. :)', '["farfalle pasta", "other pastas", "olive oil", "chicken breast", "onions", "garlic cloves", "cremini mushrooms", "button mushroom", "white wine", "chicken broth", "diced tomatoes", "dried parsley", "dried oregano", "dried basil", "red pepper flakes", "frozen spinach", "low-fat ricotta cheese"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '529.90', '35.40', '15.30', '63.90', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "鸡蛋", "麸质"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '398300', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
