('PUBLIC', NULL, '慢炖火鸡糙米辣椒', 'Slow Cooker Turkey and Brown Rice Chili', '["火鸡辣椒"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["低油", "均衡"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'This is a betty crocker recipe. Do you have ground beef in the freezer? Use it instead of the turkey, plus you won''t need to use oil when you cook it. Stir in either brown or white rice at the end. Stir in either brown or white rice at the end. This is a low-fat chili because it is made with ground turkey breast. Check that you are buying ground turkey breast and not regular ground turkey, which includes both light and dark meat and will be higher in fat. Enjoy this chili topped with your favorite salsa and corn chips.', '["onion", "diced tomatoes", "chili beans", "green chilies", "water", "sugar", "chili powder", "ground cumin", "salt", "cooked brown rice"]', 6, '1.00', '份', '316.60', '24.00', '4.10', '47.50', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '[]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '481167', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
