('PUBLIC', NULL, '低脂菠菜奶酪卷', 'Kmt''s Low Fat Ricotta Spinach Rolls', '["意式奶酪卷", "Ricotta Rolls"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["均衡"]', '[]', '[]', '["慢享"]', 'This is a treasured adoptee. Here is KMT''s original description of it: Delicious, low fat, Italian dish. Very filling too!', '["pasta", "low-fat ricotta cheese", "fat-free ricotta cheese", "part-skim mozzarella cheese", "frozen chopped spinach", "carrots", "fresh parsley", "fresh basil", "egg"]', 8, '1.00', '份', '448.30', '24.40', '12.50', '59.10', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "鸡蛋", "麸质"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '8798', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '素香肠土豆', 'Vegetarian potatoes and soyrizo', '["素食土豆煲"]', '["午餐", "晚餐"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '["快速"]', 'This is a great recipe that''s easy to make in single serving quantities. It''s also low fat and low calorie, and so good for those on a diet. To achieve maximum low-fat, substitute the olive oil for a spray, and/or use a non-stick pan.', '["olive oil", "potato", "garlic", "salsa", "onion", "bell pepper", "low-fat tortilla"]', 1, '1.00', '份', '482.40', '10.80', '14.20', '82.90', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["大豆"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '88129', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '柠檬罗非鱼', 'Mildly Lemony Tilapia', '["清爽柠檬鱼"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["均衡", "控碳水", "高蛋白"]', '["海鲜"]', '[]', '["快速"]', 'This is a fast recipe, very easy, and very low-fat. Each serving is 2 weight watchers points. It''s very mildly lemon flavored, with just the right amount of seasoning.', '["garlic powder", "dried basil", "salt", "black pepper", "lemon juice", "water"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '112.40', '22.90', '2.00', '0.90', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["鱼"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '88346', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '低碳三文鱼饼', 'low carb salmon croquettes', '["三文鱼丸"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["均衡"]', '[]', '[]', '["快速"]', 'I don''t know where this recipe came from,but they are great for low carb diets. They are rather delicate to handle.I use 2 spatulas for frying', '["salmon", "celery", "scallions", "egg", "dill", "wheat germ", "olive oil"]', 2, '1.00', '份', '276.00', '31.70', '9.00', '17.90', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["鸡蛋", "麸质", "鱼"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '88593', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '一人份素食玉米片', 'Meow''s Quick and Healthy Nachos for One (Vegetarian)', '["快手素玉米片"]', '["加餐", "午餐"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '["辣"]', '["快速"]', 'I often make this (and endless variations) when I am tired or stressed, and want something that tastes "sinful." But this is not really sinful--I promise! This is a great creamy version of nachos, since cream cheese is included. Be warned that amounts are true approximations--I make this very much in a "dump" fashion and of course don''t measure anything.', '["low-fat tortilla chips", "non-fat tortilla chips", "light cream cheese", "roma tomato", "red onions", "green peppers", "black olives", "green olives", "romaine lettuce", "sour cream", "salsa", "cumin", "kosher salt"]', 1, '1.00', '份', '450.80', '36.20', '15.70', '42.50', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '89922', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '意式香料烤猪里脊', 'Grilled Pork Tenderloin With Italian Rub', '["意大利风味猪里脊"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["均衡", "控碳水", "高蛋白"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'You will want to grill this over indirect heat. What I do is light one side of my grill and then place the tenderloins on the other side. You do not want the flame directly under the meat.', '["fresh rosemary", "garlic", "dried oregano leaves", "dried thyme", "dried rubbed sage", "salt", "ground black pepper"]', 6, '1.00', '份', '185.40', '31.40', '5.40', '0.90', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '[]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '90676', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '西兰花樱桃番茄意面沙拉', 'Broccoli, Cherry Tomato, & Pasta Salad', '["蔬菜意面沙拉"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["低油", "均衡"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'I found this recipe in Cooking Light magazine years ago and, even though it takes a bit of time to prepare, it''s still a favorite! I usually don''t use the dill (although I do like it when I happen to have it on hand), and I use 1/4 cup of sliced green onions instead of the shallots.', '["flat leaf parsley", "fresh basil leaf", "fresh dill", "fresh lemon rind", "mint leaves", "garlic", "garlic", "low fat cottage cheese", "low-fat buttermilk", "fresh lemon juice", "red wine vinegar", "extra virgin olive oil", "black pepper", "feta cheese", "broccoli florets", "cherry tomatoes", "medium pasta shells", "rotini pasta", "shallot", "capers", "black pepper", "artichoke hearts"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '347.70', '18.90', '9.70', '52.70', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "麸质"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '90806', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
