('PUBLIC', NULL, '经典法式洋葱汤', 'Classic Sweet Viadalia French Onion Soup', '["洋葱汤"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'This makes a wonderful, very flavorful french onion soup. It is based on a recipe in one of Suzanne Somers'' cookbooks, and then slightly modifed by me. It is quite low carb as is, but for an even more low-carb, low-fat version, you may use a slice of portebello mushroom, instead of the bread (just place a large mushroom slice where you would the bread, and place the cheese on top of the mushroom)and use shredded Parmesan cheese (which is a cheese that is lower in fat). A lovely soup, well-worth the trouble of making it!', '["other sweet onion", "beef broth", "red wine", "Worcestershire sauce", "mustard seeds", "celery seed", "olive oil", "butter", "provolone cheese", "gruyere cheese"]', 2, '1.00', '份', '568.90', '20.20', '25.80', '61.20', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶", "麸质"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '91793', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
('PUBLIC', NULL, '帕玛森鸡排', 'Parmesan Chicken Cutlets', '["Parmesan 鸡排"]', '["三餐"]', '[]', '[]', '["均衡", "控碳水", "高蛋白"]', '[]', '[]', '["快速"]', 'I know, the last thing RecipeZaar needs is another parmesan chicken recipe! But this one has it all! Not only is it low-fat and only has 3 points per serving but it''s very easy (only 4 ingredients) and mighty tasty, too.', '["parmesan cheese", "paprika", "boneless skinless chicken breasts"]', 4, '1.00', '份', '169.80', '26.90', '4.90', '2.70', 'foodcom_source_value', '1', '["牛奶"]', 'REVIEWED', 'APPROVED', 'foodcom-recipes-and-reviews-v2', '93115', 'v2', NULL, 'NONE', NULL, NOW(), NOW()),
